{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34368","headline":"上元日道室焚修寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"上元日道室焚修寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三清今日聚灵官，玉刺齐抽谒广寒。\n执盖冒花香寂历，侍晨交佩响阑珊。\n将排凤节分阶易，欲校龙书下笔难。\n唯有世尘中小兆，夜来心拜七星坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}